From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:09:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Support the Windows XP target vendor

Recognize winxp alongside win7 so the XP toolchain can select its own
compatibility paths. Import keyed event APIs directly on both targets,
since they are available from Windows XP on.
